: STAGEL N:D: CORE EXAMPLE
: STAGEL N:D: IS THE CORE LANGUAGE:CHAR:EE: TO BE IMPLEMENTED DIRECTLY IN WAT.
: STAGER N:D: BUILDS ON STAGEL N:D: WITH THE ADDITIONAL TYPES DESCRIBED BELOW.
: EMN:D: IS THE FULL VSO LANGUAGE BUILT ON STAGER N:D:. ONLY EMN:D: HAS FIRST:CHAR:EF:CLASS FUNCTIONS.
: IDENTIFIERS ARE ASCII CASE:CHAR:EF:INSENSITIVE. TYPING IS STRICT. THERE IS NO AUTOMATIC COERCION.
: CORE TYPES: B:CHAR:EE: T :CHAR:EA::CHAR:DE:LETTERS:CHAR:DE::CHAR:EB::CHAR:EE: UN:I::CHAR:EE: IN:D:N:C::CHAR:EE: UN:D:N:C::CHAR:EE: IN:G:N:E::CHAR:EE: UN:G:N:E::CHAR:EE: L/T:CHAR:EE: VOID:CHAR:EE: NEVER.
: LETTERS IS A STRING IN THE STAGEL INTERMEDIATE CHARACTER SET: A:CHAR:EF:Z:CHAR:EE: SLASH:CHAR:EE: COLON:CHAR:EE: SPACE:CHAR:EE: NEWLINE:CHAR:EE: QUOTATION MARK:CHAR:EE: DOT.
: LETTERS VALUES ARE OPAQUE IDENTIFIERS:CHAR:EE: NOT BYTE DATA. THEY SUPPORT COMPARISON:CHAR:EE: SPLITTING:CHAR:EE: AND JOINING. MEMORY REPRESENTATION IS UNSPECIFIED.
: T:CHAR:DE:ABC:CHAR:DE: IS A LETTERS LITERAL. THE T STANDS FOR TEXT OR LETTERS:CHAR:EE: NOT A GENERAL UNICODE STRING TYPE.
: B:CHAR:DE:ABC:CHAR:DE: IS AN L/UN:I: BYTE LITERAL USING THE SLASH ESCAPES BELOW. IT IS AVAILABLE IN STAGEL N:D: AND INHERITED BY STAGER N:D:.
: A BARE :CHAR:DE:ABC:CHAR:DE: IS A STAGER N:D: S LITERAL USING DCTS:CHAR:EE: NOT A STAGEL N:D: LITERAL AND NOT JSON STRING SYNTAX.
: THE NORMALIZED STAGEL CHARACTER SET USES N:D:N:C: CHARACTERS: A:CHAR:EF:Z:CHAR:EE: SLASH:CHAR:EE: COLON:CHAR:EE: SPACE:CHAR:EE: NEWLINE:CHAR:EE: QUOTATION MARK:CHAR:EE: AND DOT.
: INPUT FILES MAY USE ANY OTHER CHARACTERS IN COMMENTS. IDENTIFIERS AND LETTERS LITERALS NORMALIZE TO UPPERCASE.
: THUS ASSERT EQ T:CHAR:DE:A:CHAR:DE: T:CHAR:DE:A:CHAR:DE: SHALL PASS. OPEN: SPECIFY ASSERT:CHAR:EE: RETURNING UNIT ON SUCCESS AND A DEFINED FAULT ON FAILURE.
: OUTSIDE LITERALS/COMMENTS:CHAR:EE: SEMICOLON NORMALIZES TO DOT AND CLOSING BRACE NORMALIZES TO :: DOUBLE COLON.
: SOURCE BYTE ESCAPES USE SLASH: /:CHAR:DE: :CHAR:GB: QUOTATION MARK:CHAR:EE: // :CHAR:GB: SLASH:CHAR:EE: /XN:B:A :CHAR:GB: SUBSTITUTE:CHAR:EE: /N:A: :CHAR:GB: NULL:CHAR:EE: /A :CHAR:GB: BELL:CHAR:EE: /B :CHAR:GB: BACKSPACE.
: FURTHER BYTE ESCAPES: /T :CHAR:GB: HORIZONTAL TAB:CHAR:EE: /N :CHAR:GB: NEWLINE:CHAR:EE: /V :CHAR:GB: VERTICAL TAB:CHAR:EE: /F :CHAR:GB: FORM FEED:CHAR:EE: /R :CHAR:GB: CARRIAGE RETURN.
: /X HEXADECIMAL ESCAPES ARE PERMITTED THROUGH /XFF. /XN:F:C REPRESENTS BACKSLASH. BYTE LISTS HAVE NO INHERENT CHARACTER SEMANTICS.
: OPEN: SPECIFY EXACTLY TWO HEX DIGITS:CHAR:EE: MALFORMED:CHAR:EF:ESCAPE ERRORS:CHAR:EE: RAW NON:CHAR:EF:ASCII BYTES:CHAR:EE: AND WHICH ESCAPES ARE VALID IN T LITERALS.
: OPEN: SPECIFY LOSSLESS BYTE/DCTS LITERAL NORMALIZATION: DO NOT INFER PAYLOAD CASE FOLDING FROM IDENTIFIER/LETTERS NORMALIZATION.
: OPEN: SPECIFY THE DIGIT:CHAR:EF:FREE INTERMEDIATE ENCODING OF ESCAPES SUCH AS /XN:B:A AND /N:A::CHAR:EE: AND DCTS QUOTE FRAMING.
: STRING :CHAR:EA:DCMST:CHAR:EB: SPLIT :CHAR:GB: EXPLODE :CHAR:DE:B:CHAR:DE: :CHAR:DE:ABC:CHAR:DE: YIELDS L/S: :CHAR:DE:A:CHAR:DE: :CHAR:DE:C:CHAR:DE: ::
: BINARY STRING SPLIT :CHAR:GB: EXPLODEB B:CHAR:DE:B:CHAR:DE: B:CHAR:DE:ABC:CHAR:DE: YIELDS L/L/UN:I:: B:CHAR:DE:A:CHAR:DE: B:CHAR:DE:C:CHAR:DE: ::
: BINARY STRING JOIN :CHAR:GB: CATB B:CHAR:DE:A:CHAR:DE: CATB B:CHAR:DE:B:CHAR:DE: B:CHAR:DE:C:CHAR:DE: YIELDS B:CHAR:DE:ABC:CHAR:DE:
: BINARY STRING JOIN :CHAR:GB: IMPLODEB L/L/UN:I:: B:CHAR:DE:A:CHAR:DE: B:CHAR:DE:B:CHAR:DE: B:CHAR:DE:C:CHAR:DE: :: YIELDS B:CHAR:DE:ABC:CHAR:DE:
: RECOMMENDATION: KEEP EXPLODE/IMPLODE IN LIBRARIES:CHAR:EE: WITH EFFICIENT BULK CONSTRUCTION. REPEATED COPYING CAT CAN TAKE QUADRATIC TIME.
: LETTERS SPLITTING: EXPLODEL T:CHAR:DE:B:CHAR:DE: T:CHAR:DE:ABC:CHAR:DE: YIELDS L/T: T:CHAR:DE:A:CHAR:DE: T:CHAR:DE:C:CHAR:DE: ::. ANALOGOUS DCS OPERATIONS BELONG TO STAGER N:D:.
: OPEN: SPECIFY EMPTY SEPARATORS:CHAR:EE: OVERLAPPING MATCHES:CHAR:EE: RETAINED EMPTY PIECES:CHAR:EE: AND DCMST BINARY:CHAR:EF:RUN MATCHING.
: OPEN: RECONCILE CATB WITH GENERIC CONCAT FOR L/UN:I:. PREFER ONE CANONICAL CONCATENATION OPERATION:CHAR:EE: NOT DUPLICATE ALIASES.
: THE LITERAL FORMS AND OPAQUE LETTERS SEMANTICS ARE RESOLVED. THEIR LEXICAL EDGE CASES AND NORMALIZATION ARE NOT YET IMPLEMENTED.
: B LITERALS: TRUE:CHAR:EE: FALSE. THERE IS NO UNSPECIFIED NUMERIC TYPE N.
: L/T IS A LIST OF SUPPORTED ELEMENT TYPE T. V/RETURN/NAME DECLARES A NAMED VERB:CHAR:EE: NOT A FUNCTION VALUE.
: EVERYTHING IS EXPRESSION:CHAR:EF:ORIENTED:CHAR:EE: LIKE LISP: EVERY NORMALLY COMPLETING EXPRESSION RETURNS A VALUE.
: VOID IS THE UNIT VALUE:CHAR:EE: RETURNED BY DECLARATIONS:CHAR:EE: NEW:CHAR:EE: SET:CHAR:EE: NORMALLY COMPLETED LOOPS:CHAR:EE: AND EMPTY BLOCKS.
: NEVER DOES NOT RETURN NORMALLY. IT DOES NOT DENOTE A RETURNED VALUE.
: CHECKED CORE OPERATIONS RETURN T. INVALID ARITHMETIC TERMINATES EVALUATION WITH A DEFINED FAULT:CHAR:EE: NEVER SILENT WRAPPING.
: PURE CANADD/CANSUB/CANMUL/CANDIV PREDICATES ALLOW RECOVERY BEFORE THE OPERATION. STAGER N:D: TRYADD/TRYSUB/TRYMUL/TRYDIV RETURN RESULT/T.
: THESE ARITHMETIC CHOICES ARE PROPOSALS:CHAR:EE: NOT RESOLVED SEMANTICS. STAGER N:D: MUST NOT CHANGE THE RETURN TYPES OF INHERITED CORE OPERATIONS.
: OPENING BRACES ARE PROHIBITED OUTSIDE STRINGS/COMMENTS. BLOCK AND LIST OPENINGS ARE IMPLICIT.
: DECLARATIONS: :CHAR:JB:LET:CHAR:JD: V/RETURN/NAME TYPE/PARAMETER ... HEADER:CHAR:JF:END BODY.
: HEADER:CHAR:JF:END IS NEWLINE FOR AN INDENTED BODY:CHAR:EE: OR :: FOR AN INLINE BODY CONTAINING ONE STATEMENT.
: INDENTATION DELIMITS DECLARATION BODIES. DOT ENDS STATEMENTS. SEMICOLON NORMALIZES TO DOT OUTSIDE LITERALS/COMMENTS.
: STATEMENTS ARE EXPRESSIONS. THE FINAL EXPRESSION SUPPLIES A BODY:CHAR:DJ:S VALUE. EARLIER VALUES ARE DISCARDED.
: DOT AND SEMICOLON DO NOT SUPPRESS THE FINAL VALUE. AN EMPTY BODY RETURNS UNIT OF TYPE VOID.
: PREFIX CALLS HAVE FIXED ARITY. COLLECT VERB SIGNATURES BEFORE PARSING BODIES. OVERLOADING IS PROHIBITED.
: DIRECT CALLS USE NAME ARGUMENTS. NAMED NESTED VERBS ARE ALLOWED IN STAGEL N:D: AND STAGER N:D:.
: FUNCTION VALUES:CHAR:EE: ANONYMOUS VERBS:CHAR:EE: PASSED CALLBACKS:CHAR:EE: AND RETURNED VERBS ARE EMN:D::CHAR:EF:ONLY.
: STAGEL N:D: AND STAGER N:D: CANNOT ASSIGN:CHAR:EE: PASS:CHAR:EE: OR RETURN A VERB AS A VALUE.
: TAIL CALLS DO NOT GROW THE CALL STACK:CHAR:EE: INCLUDING MUTUAL TAIL CALLS. THIS IS REQUIRED:CHAR:EE: NOT OPTIONAL OPTIMIZATION.
: A CALL IS IN TAIL POSITION WHEN ITS RESULT IS RETURNED DIRECTLY:CHAR:EE: INCLUDING THROUGH A FINAL BLOCK OR IF BRANCH.
: NON:CHAR:EF:TAIL CALLS MAY GROW THE STACK. STACK:CHAR:EF:SAFE TAIL CALLS DO NOT IMPLY BOUNDED HEAP USE.
: IF CONDITION THEN ELSE TAKES EXPRESSIONS:CHAR:EE: REQUIRES B:CHAR:EE: AND EVALUATES ONLY THE SELECTED BRANCH.
: IF RETURNS THE SELECTED EXPRESSION:CHAR:DJ:S VALUE.
: BRANCH RESULT TYPES MUST AGREE:CHAR:EE: EXCEPT NEVER IS COMPATIBLE WITH EITHER BRANCH:CHAR:DJ:S TYPE.
: DO INTRODUCES AN IMPLICIT EXPRESSION BLOCK:CHAR:EE: TERMINATED BY ::. ITS FINAL EXPRESSION SUPPLIES ITS VALUE.
: WHILE CONDITION BODY REEVALUATES BOTH EXPRESSIONS AS NEEDED. CONDITION MUST RETURN B:CHAR:EE: BODY UNIT OF TYPE VOID.
: FOREACH LIST BODY EVALUATES LIST ONCE AND BODY FOR EACH ELEMENT. BODY MUST RETURN UNIT OF TYPE VOID.
: LOOP BODIES AND CONDITIONAL BRANCHES ARE EXPRESSIONS:CHAR:EE: NOT FIRST:CHAR:EF:CLASS CALLBACKS.
: FOREACH PROVIDES READ:CHAR:EF:ONLY T/THIS. NESTED FOREACH IS PROHIBITED UNTIL AN EXPLICIT ELEMENT:CHAR:EF:BINDING SYNTAX IS DEFINED.
: BREAK EXITS THE NEAREST LOOP. CONTINUE STARTS ITS NEXT ITERATION. NEITHER ACCEPTS A LABEL OR LEVEL COUNT.
: BOTH HAVE TYPE NEVER AT THEIR OCCURRENCE AND CANNOT CROSS A VERB BOUNDARY.
: BINDINGS ARE IN SCOPE THROUGHOUT THEIR BLOCK:CHAR:EE: INCLUDING BEFORE THEIR DECLARATION. SHADOWING IS PROHIBITED.
: NEW TYPE/NAME VALUE DECLARES AND INITIALIZES A MUTABLE BINDING. SET TYPE/NAME VALUE MUTATES IT. BOTH RETURN UNIT.
: READS OR WRITES BEFORE INITIALIZATION ARE REJECTED. VERB DECLARATIONS ARE AVAILABLE THROUGHOUT THEIR BLOCK.
: A NESTED FUNCTION CAPTURES SHARED LEXICAL BINDINGS FROM WHERE IT WAS DEFINED:CHAR:EE: NOT WHERE IT IS CALLED.
: MUTATIONS ARE VISIBLE TO ALL USERS OF A CAPTURED BINDING. CALLER LOCALS DO NOT REPLACE THE DEFINITION:CHAR:EF:SITE ENVIRONMENT.
: ONLY EMN:D: CLOSURES CAN ESCAPE AS VALUES AND KEEP CAPTURED BINDINGS ALIVE AFTER THE DEFINING INVOCATION RETURNS.
: OPEN: SPECIFY DEFINITE:CHAR:EF:INITIALIZATION CHECKS ACROSS NESTED CALLS:CHAR:EE: CAPTURE LOWERING:CHAR:EE: AND STACK:CHAR:EF:SAFE TAIL:CHAR:EF:CALL LOWERING.
: TYPED NUMBERS USE UN:D:N:C::N:A:.
: LIST LITERALS START WITH L/T: AND END WITH ::. ELEMENTS ARE EXPRESSIONS:CHAR:EE: SUCH AS L/UN:D:N:C:: UN:D:N:C::N:A: UN:D:N:C::N:B: ::.
: EQ/NE COMPARE SAME:CHAR:EF:TYPED VALUES. CONCAT RETURNS A NEW LIST. LEN RETURNS UN:G:N:E: AND COUNTS LIST ELEMENTS.
: FOREACH ITERATES A SNAPSHOT.
: A COLON FOLLOWED BY SPACE:CHAR:EE: OR A COLON ALONE ON A LINE:CHAR:EE: STARTS A COMMENT THROUGH NEWLINE AFTER OPTIONAL INDENTATION.
: A LEADING :: IS A DELIMITER:CHAR:EE: NOT A COMMENT. THE QUOTE:CHAR:EF:AWARE LEXER MUST ALSO DISTINGUISH LITERAL CONTENTS FROM COMMENTS.
: TEST LABEL HAS INDENTED IN/OUT LINES: IN SUPPLIES ARGUMENTS. OUT SUPPLIES ONE EXPECTED VALUE.
: OPEN: SPECIFY ABI:CHAR:EE: OWNERSHIP:CHAR:EE: AND NON:CHAR:EF:TAIL RECURSION LIMITS. THESE EXAMPLES ARE DESIGN:CHAR:EE: NOT AN IMPLEMENTED RUNTIME.

: LEADING LET IS OPTIONAL. INLINE BODIES END THEIR PARAMETER LIST WITH ::.
LET V/B/ISEMPTY L/UN:D:N:C:/ITEMS
    TEST WORKS WITH EMPTY LIST
        IN L/UN:D:N:C:: ::
        OUT TRUE
    TEST WORKS WITH NONEMPTY LIST
        IN L/UN:D:N:C:: UN:D:N:C::N:H: ::
        OUT FALSE
    EQ UN:G:N:E::N:A: LEN L/UN:D:N:C:/ITEMS.

V/B/NNE IN:G:N:E:/A IN:G:N:E:/B :: NE IN:G:N:E:/A IN:G:N:E:/B.
LET V/B/NNEDOT IN:G:N:E:/A IN:G:N:E:/B :: NE IN:G:N:E:/A IN:G:N:E:/B.
LET V/B/NNESEMICOLON IN:G:N:E:/A IN:G:N:E:/B :: NE IN:G:N:E:/A IN:G:N:E:/B.

V/L/UN:D:N:C:/APPENDUN:D:N:C: L/UN:D:N:C:/A L/UN:D:N:C:/B
    TEST WORKS
        IN L/UN:D:N:C:: UN:D:N:C::N:A: UN:D:N:C::N:B: :: L/UN:D:N:C:: UN:D:N:C::N:C: UN:D:N:C::N:D: ::
        OUT L/UN:D:N:C:: UN:D:N:C::N:A: UN:D:N:C::N:B: UN:D:N:C::N:C: UN:D:N:C::N:D: ::
    CONCAT L/UN:D:N:C:/A L/UN:D:N:C:/B.

: THE NESTED READER CAPTURES THIS INVOCATION:CHAR:DJ:S BINDING:CHAR:EE: EVEN WHEN CALLED BY A SIBLING VERB.
V/UN:D:N:C:/LEXICALCAPTURE UN:D:N:C:/INITIAL
    TEST READS THE SHARED BINDING AFTER MUTATION
        IN UN:D:N:C::N:H:
        OUT UN:D:N:C::N:J:
    NEW UN:D:N:C:/CAPTURED UN:D:N:C:/INITIAL.
    V/UN:D:N:C:/READCAPTURED :: UN:D:N:C:/CAPTURED.
    V/UN:D:N:C:/CALLFROMSIBLING
        NEW UN:D:N:C:/CALLERLOCAL UN:D:N:C::N:J:N:J:.
        READCAPTURED.
    SET UN:D:N:C:/CAPTURED UN:D:N:C::N:J:.
    CALLFROMSIBLING.

: BOTH DIRECTIONS OF THIS MUTUAL RECURSION ARE TAIL CALLS:CHAR:EE: INCLUDING THE SELECTED IF BRANCH.
V/B/TAILFIRST B/STOP
    TEST TAKES THE TAIL CALL
        IN FALSE
        OUT FALSE
    IF B/STOP TRUE TAILSECOND TRUE.
V/B/TAILSECOND B/STOP :: IF B/STOP FALSE TAILFIRST TRUE.

: NEW:CHAR:EE: SET:CHAR:EE: AND FOREACH RETURN UNIT. THE FINAL EXPRESSION SUPPLIES THE LIST VALUE.
V/L/UN:D:N:C:/COPYLIST L/UN:D:N:C:/ITEMS
    TEST COPIES THE LIST
        IN L/UN:D:N:C:: UN:D:N:C::N:C: UN:D:N:C::N:D: ::
        OUT L/UN:D:N:C:: UN:D:N:C::N:C: UN:D:N:C::N:D: ::
    NEW L/UN:D:N:C:/COPIED L/UN:D:N:C:: ::.
    FOREACH L/UN:D:N:C:/ITEMS DO
        SET L/UN:D:N:C:/COPIED CONCAT L/UN:D:N:C:/COPIED L/UN:D:N:C:: UN:D:N:C:/THIS ::.
    ::.
    L/UN:D:N:C:/COPIED.

: AN EMPTY BLOCK IS A UNIT EXPRESSION:CHAR:EE: SO BOTH BRANCHES RETURN A VALUE OF TYPE VOID.
V/VOID/UNITCHOICE B/CONDITION :: IF B/CONDITION DO :: DO ::.

: STAGER N:D: EXTENSION NOTES AND EXAMPLES. EVERYTHING BELOW IS COMMENTARY:CHAR:EE: NOT STAGEL N:D: CODE.
: ADDED TYPES: IN:B:N:C:N:I::CHAR:EE: UN:B:N:C:N:I::CHAR:EE: INT:CHAR:EE: RAT:CHAR:EE: DC:CHAR:EE: VIEW:CHAR:EE: CURSOR:CHAR:EE: S:CHAR:EE: DCS:CHAR:EE: OPTION/T:CHAR:EE: RESULT/T.
: S IS THE DEFAULT DCMST MIXED:CHAR:EF:MODE DOCUMENT:CHAR:EF:STRING VALUE:CHAR:EE: REPRESENTED BY DCMSTR/DCMSTRING IN RUST. IT IS NOT JUST UNICODE TEXT.
: DCS IS A DC:CHAR:EF:CHARACTER STRING:CHAR:EE: REPRESENTED BY DCSTR/DCSTRING IN RUST. DC IS A STRONGLY TYPED UN:B:N:C:N:I::CHAR:EE: NOT AN ORDINARY INTEGER.
: RUST BORROWING AND OWNERSHIP SUFFIXES ARE IMPLEMENTATION DETAILS:CHAR:EE: NOT EXTRA STAGER N:D: LANGUAGE TYPES.
: INT IS ARBITRARY:CHAR:EF:PRECISION. RAT CONTAINS NUM:INT AND DEN:INT. DEN IS NONZERO:CHAR:EE: POSITIVE:CHAR:EE: AND COPRIME TO NUM.
: ZERO RAT IS NORMALIZED TO N:A:/N:B:. MAKERAT NUM DEN RETURNS RESULT/RAT. ZERO DENOMINATOR YIELDS ERR:CHAR:EA:INVALID:CHAR:JF:DENOMINATOR:CHAR:EB:.
: RESULT/T IS ERR:CHAR:EA:ERROR:CHAR:EB: OR OK:CHAR:EA:T:CHAR:EB:. OPTION/T IS NONE OR SOME:CHAR:EA:T:CHAR:EB:.
: CONSTRUCTORS: RESULT/T:ERR ERROR:CHAR:EE: RESULT/T:OK VALUE:CHAR:EE: OPTION/T:NONE:CHAR:EE: OPTION/T:SOME VALUE.
: ERROR VARIANTS INCLUDE OVERFLOW:CHAR:EE: DIVISION:CHAR:JF:BY:CHAR:JF:ZERO:CHAR:EE: INVALID:CHAR:JF:DENOMINATOR. LITERALS USE ERROR:NAME.
: PROPOSED STAGER N:D: TRYADD/TRYSUB/TRYMUL/TRYDIV RETURN RESULT/T. FIXED:CHAR:EF:WIDTH OVERFLOW PRODUCES ERR:CHAR:EA:OVERFLOW:CHAR:EB::CHAR:EE: NEVER WRAPPING.
: DIVISION BY ZERO PRODUCES ERR:CHAR:EA:DIVISION:CHAR:JF:BY:CHAR:JF:ZERO:CHAR:EB:. AN UNREPRESENTABLE QUOTIENT PRODUCES ERR:CHAR:EA:OVERFLOW:CHAR:EB:.
: ERRORS ARE ORDINARY RESULT VALUES:CHAR:EE: NOT AUTOMATIC RETURNS FROM THE ENCLOSING VERB.
: OPEN: DEFINE EXTENSIBLE ERROR PAYLOADS:CHAR:EE: RESULT/OPTION MATCHING:CHAR:EE: AND EXPLICIT ERROR PROPAGATION SYNTAX.
: OPEN: DEFINE INTEGER DIVISION ROUNDING:CHAR:EE: REMAINDER SIGNS:CHAR:EE: SHIFTS:CHAR:EE: CONVERSIONS:CHAR:EE: AND ALLOCATION:CHAR:EF:FAILURE BEHAVIOR.
: VIEW CONTAINS SOURCE:CHAR:JF:ID:UN:D:N:C::CHAR:EE: OFFSET:UN:G:N:E::CHAR:EE: LEN:UN:G:N:E:. CURSOR CONTAINS POS:UN:G:N:E: AND A VIEW.
: OPEN: DEFINE SOURCE LIFETIMES:CHAR:EE: CHECKED VIEW BOUNDS:CHAR:EE: CURSOR OWNERSHIP:CHAR:EE: AND ENFORCE POS :CHAR:GA::CHAR:GB: LEN.
: BARE :CHAR:DE:...:CHAR:DE: USES DCTS TO CONSTRUCT S:CHAR:EE: INCLUDING NON:CHAR:EF:UNICODE DCS. B:CHAR:DE:...:CHAR:DE: CONSTRUCTS BYTES. T:CHAR:DE:...:CHAR:DE: CONSTRUCTS LETTERS.
: THERE IS NO SEPARATE DCS LITERAL SPELLING RESOLVED HERE. CONVERTING MIXED:CHAR:EF:MODE STRINGS TO DCS MUST BE EXPLICIT AND FALLIBLE.
: OPEN: DEFINE STRING EQUALITY AND LENGTH FOR DCMST BINARY RUNS. DO NOT CONFUSE BYTES:CHAR:EE: DC CHARACTERS:CHAR:EE: AND UNICODE CODE POINTS.
: OPEN: SPECIFY DCTS EMBEDDING BOUNDARIES AND HOW OUTER QUOTE ESCAPING COMPOSES WITH DCTS. PRESERVE LITERAL PAYLOAD VALUES DURING NORMALIZATION.
: OPEN: SPECIFY ABI:CHAR:EE: OWNERSHIP:CHAR:EE: AND WASM LOWERING FOR WIDE INTEGERS:CHAR:EE: INT:CHAR:EE: RAT:CHAR:EE: AND STRINGS.
: UNIMPLEMENTED MESSAGE IS A DEVELOPMENT:CHAR:EF:ONLY NEVER:CHAR:EF:RETURNING STUB:CHAR:EE: NOT RECOVERABLE ERROR HANDLING.
:
: V/B/ZL S/IN
:     TEST WORKS WITH ZERO LENGTH STRING
:         IN :CHAR:DE::CHAR:DE:
:         OUT TRUE
:     TEST WORKS WITH NONZERO LENGTH STRING
:         IN :CHAR:DE:A:CHAR:DE:
:         OUT FALSE
:     EQ UN:G:N:E::N:A: LEN S/IN.
: PROPOSED CHECKED WRAPPER:CHAR:EE: PENDING THE ARITHMETIC DECISION:
: V/RESULT/IN:G:N:E:/ADDCHECKED IN:G:N:E:/A IN:G:N:E:/B :: TRYADD IN:G:N:E:/A IN:G:N:E:/B.
: V/S/DEFAULT S/A S/B :: IF ZL S/A S/B S/A.
: V/S/GETFORMATIMPORTSETTING S/A S/B :: UNIMPLEMENTED :CHAR:DE:IMPORT SETTINGS:CHAR:DE:.
: V/S/DCGETMAPPINGTOFORMAT DC/A S/B :: UNIMPLEMENTED :CHAR:DE:DC MAPPING:CHAR:DE:.
: V/S/GETENVCODELANGUAGE :: UNIMPLEMENTED :CHAR:DE:ENVIRONMENT LANGUAGE:CHAR:DE:.
:
: V/S/GETTARGETLANGUAGEFORDCTCODETOTEXT
:     NEW S/TARGETLANGUAGE GETFORMATIMPORTSETTING :CHAR:DE:CODETOTEXT:CHAR:DE: :CHAR:DE:LANGUAGE:CHAR:DE:.
:     IF ZL S/TARGETLANGUAGE GETENVCODELANGUAGE S/TARGETLANGUAGE.
:
: OPEN: DEFINE ELAD DECODING AND MALFORMED:CHAR:EF:INPUT ERRORS.
: V/L/DC/DCAFROMELAD S/IN :: UNIMPLEMENTED :CHAR:DE:ELAD DECODING:CHAR:DE:.
: V/L/DC/PUSH L/DC/IN DC/TOPUSH
:     CONCAT L/DC/IN L/DC: DC/TOPUSH ::.
:
: OPEN: MISSING MAPPINGS SHOULD BE OPTION/S. EMPTY TEXT MAY BE A VALID MAPPING.
: V/L/DC/CONVERTELEMENTANDAPPEND DC/E S/TARGETLANGUAGE L/DC/CONVERTED
:     NEW S/TEMP DCGETMAPPINGTOFORMAT DC/E S/TARGETLANGUAGE.
:     IF NE UN:G:N:E::N:A: LEN S/TEMP
:         CONCAT L/DC/CONVERTED DCAFROMELAD S/TEMP
:         PUSH L/DC/CONVERTED DC/E.
:
: OPEN: THIS RETURNS DC VALUES:CHAR:EE: NOT S OR DCS. DEFINE THE INTENDED TEXT CONVERSION.
: V/L/DC/DCTCODETOTEXT L/DC/IN
:     NEW L/DC/RES L/DC: ::.
:     NEW S/TARGETLANGUAGE GETTARGETLANGUAGEFORDCTCODETOTEXT.
:     FOREACH L/DC/IN DO
:         SET L/DC/RES CONVERTELEMENTANDAPPEND DC/THIS S/TARGETLANGUAGE L/DC/RES.
:     ::.
:     L/DC/RES.
:
: EMN:D::CHAR:EF:ONLY: V/T:CHAR:JB:A:CHAR:EE:B:CHAR:JD: DESCRIBES A FUNCTION VALUE TAKING A:CHAR:EE:B AND RETURNING T. V/T:CHAR:JB::CHAR:JD: TAKES NO ARGUMENTS.
: EMN:D::CHAR:EF:ONLY: /NAME REFERS TO A FUNCTION VALUE. CALL /NAME ARGUMENTS INVOKES IT.
: RETURNING A FUNCTION THAT CAPTURES A FALLBACK BELONGS TO EMN:D::CHAR:EE: NOT STAGEL N:D: OR STAGER N:D:.
: OPEN: SPECIFY EMN:D: FUNCTION:CHAR:EF:VALUE DECLARATION SYNTAX:CHAR:EE: ESCAPING CLOSURE OWNERSHIP:CHAR:EE: AND LOWERING.